+
+## Optional supporter tips
+
+The homepage and company pages include a small support card below the research content, with a shared footer link on generated pages. Both open [Cheng's Buy Me a Coffee page](https://buymeacoffee.com/neoy) in a new tab. One coffee is €5; monthly support is disabled. Tips are optional and do not unlock paid content or affect free charts/downloads. The creator profile identifies Stock Value Lens and links back to the website.
+
+This is a plain external link: no payment widget, Buy Me a Coffee script, or payment details are loaded on Stock Value Lens. No new analytics events were added; completed support is recorded by Buy Me a Coffee rather than inferred from link clicks.
