+## Optional Buy Me a Coffee support — 2026-10-10
+
+- **Creator settings:** Existing https://buymeacoffee.com/neoy profile updated to identify Stock Value Lens and link back to https://stockvaluelens.com/. Existing writing biography and Medium link preserved. Currency is EUR, standard coffee price €5, monthly support disabled. Credit-card fee coverage remains enabled; no membership or shop products created. Saved thank-you preview verified. Payout page reports an existing connected account; no payout/financial account changes or test payment performed.
+- **Website:** Plain external support links, with target=_blank and noopener/noreferrer. Support cards sit below homepage/company research content; shared footer link available across generated pages. No payment widgets/scripts, new analytics events, or CSP changes.
+- **Checks:** All 42 Node and five Python tests pass. Production build passes with 499 HTML routes, 485 company pages and 7,566 assets. Generated-link audit found exactly 486 support cards and 499 footer support links. All 6,551 company JSON files match the preceding build; app.js, calculations.js, pe.js, analytics.js, ui.js, _headers and data/index.json unchanged. Desktop screenshot reviewed; at 390×844 the card is 366 px wide, uses a column layout, has a 45 px button and no document horizontal overflow.
+- **Publication:** Published Cloudflare version `d2cccfab-f258-4956-9647-a9c2ee4de233` to https://stockvaluelens.com. Wrangler uploaded 501 changed assets. Seven live endpoints (homepage, Apple/Microsoft pages, styles, HTML/Markdown updates and Apple JSON) return HTTP 200 and exactly match the build. The live homepage visibly renders the support card; browser warning/error logs are empty.
+- **Evidence:** Desktop/mobile, creator-profile, support-settings and live website screenshots are retained with the companion repository release record.
+- **Logs:** PROJECT_LOG and public update history updated for this user-visible feature. No new defect or non-trivial issue was found, so ISSUE_LOG was assessed and left unchanged. The website source folder has no Git repository; the companion stock-industry-analysis repository retains the release evidence and source diff.
+
